---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-22 - Correction Request and Review
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STU as Student
    actor ADV as Advisor
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as CorrectionRequestsController
    participant S as CorrectionRequestService
    participant G as IAccessGuardService
    participant K as IAttributeKeyService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STU->>W: Pick a value, give the correct value and a reason
    W->>C: POST /api/CorrectionRequests {studentDataId, proposedValue, explanation}
    C->>S: CreateAsync(CreatorId, request)
    S->>R: Row must be the student's latest value, not missing or erased, no pending request for it
    S->>K: EncryptValuesAsync(currentValue, proposedValue)
    S->>R: CreateAsync(request, status = pending)
    R->>DB: INSERT CORRECTIONREQUESTS
    ADV->>W: Open pending correction requests
    W->>C: GET /api/CorrectionRequests/search?status=pending
    C->>S: SearchAsync(AdvisorId, request)
    S->>G: CheckAccessAsync (values only shown when allowed) and LogAccessBatchAsync
    alt approve
        W->>C: PUT /api/CorrectionRequests/{id}/approve {decisionNotes}
        C->>S: ApproveAsync(AdvisorId, Id, request)
        S->>K: EncryptValuesAsync(proposed value)
        S->>R: PrepareCreate STUDENTDATA row (status = correction, same validFrom, transactionFrom = now)
        S->>R: PrepareUpdate request (approved, reviewedBy, decidedAt), SaveAsync()
    else reject
        W->>C: PUT /api/CorrectionRequests/{id}/reject {decisionNotes}
        C->>S: RejectAsync(AdvisorId, Id, request)
        S->>R: UpdateAsync(rejected, reviewedBy, decidedAt)
    end
    R->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE
    S->>N: NotifyAsync(student, decision)
    C-->>W: 200 OK
